{"name": "BALSEO: The Sea Beyond", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You embody the <strong>Tempilcahue</strong>, the mythical ferryman of souls. A powerful warlock has invaded your dimension, capturing the spirits transitioning to the afterlife. Venture into the mist, confront the unknown, make unlikely allies, and discover how to guide the souls to their final destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Art of Stealth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move through the fog with cunning and agility as you master the art of deception, traps, and distraction. Study your enemies' patterns and decide whether to slip by unnoticed or strike from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/d1b5cc573f5136ed389b7cfa2e91c992.poster.avif?t=1794511668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/d1b5cc573f5136ed389b7cfa2e91c992.webm?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/d1b5cc573f5136ed389b7cfa2e91c992.mp4?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pacts and Witchcraft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn forbidden charms, transmutations, and summonings. Meet powerful sorcerers of the archipelago and strike bargains to uncover their secrets. How far are you willing to go to restore order?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/1519aae37d51679d3ee024e121ec581a.poster.avif?t=1794511668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/1519aae37d51679d3ee024e121ec581a.webm?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/1519aae37d51679d3ee024e121ec581a.mp4?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Escape is Your Salvation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If discovered, the calm shatters, giving way to a frantic pursuit. There is no room for combat: run, improvise, and evade your pursuers in a desperate race to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/ea959c24ebce444604db1179d353c443.poster.avif?t=1794511668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/ea959c24ebce444604db1179d353c443.webm?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/ea959c24ebce444604db1179d353c443.mp4?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mysticism and Roots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a narrative inspired by the Chilotan worldview. Discover a nautical, magical, and dark culture of South America; a captivating mysticism rarely seen in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/6961cbecbcc2951dad19735cf0a66942.poster.avif?t=1794511668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/6961cbecbcc2951dad19735cf0a66942.webm?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/6961cbecbcc2951dad19735cf0a66942.mp4?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adapt to the Extraordinary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an environment where mythological beings are not mere legends, but part of a tangible reality. They roam the landscape as naturally as wild animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/1cfd24c05a229292470f42a516d4325e.poster.avif?t=1794511668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/1cfd24c05a229292470f42a516d4325e.webm?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/1cfd24c05a229292470f42a516d4325e.mp4?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immerse Yourself in the Fog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transport yourself to the heart of the archipelago through an evocative art style and the powerful local folk soundtrack by Grupo Chilhu\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/dfd5976ac8f8b10fcef31c5a286d8b28.poster.avif?t=1794511668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/dfd5976ac8f8b10fcef31c5a286d8b28.webm?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/extras/dfd5976ac8f8b10fcef31c5a286d8b28.mp4?t=1794511668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "BALSEO: The Sea Beyond is a stealth adventure shrouded in a dark, mythological atmosphere. Master stealth, learn powerful spells, and flee when necessary. Explore a mysterious archipelago and discover what hides behind the fog.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338640/9647b7537019839cc9a85c47fc93338baea25b3e/header.jpg?t=1794511668", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Stealth", "RPG", "Mythology", "Psychological Horror", "Exploration", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Quitral Games", "publishers": "Quitral Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4338640", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/kUop9xJL4qc", "first_seen": 1794438000.0, "review_rank": 8}